  "Usage": {
    "Usage": "资源占用"
  },
  "At rest Aibou needs under 1 % CPU and about 130 MB of memory. Costs come almost only from movement: every drawn frame costs CPU in Qt and the graphics driver, so they rise with the refresh rate. Figures below were measured at 2560×1600 and 165 Hz on Intel Iris Xe.": {
    "At rest Aibou needs under 1 % CPU and about 130 MB of memory. Costs come almost only from movement: every drawn frame costs CPU in Qt and the graphics driver, so they rise with the refresh rate. Figures below were measured at 2560×1600 and 165 Hz on Intel Iris Xe.": "静止时 Aibou 占用不到 1 % CPU，内存约 130 MB。开销几乎只来自移动：每绘制一帧都要在 Qt 和显卡驱动中消耗 CPU，所以开销随刷新率上升。以下数值在 Intel Iris Xe、2560×1600、165 Hz 下测得。"
  },
  "Shortcuts: Mod+Alt+M bring to front, Mod+Alt+C chat window, Mod+Alt+Z sleep or wake, Mod+Alt+B ball, Mod+Alt+Shift+M on or off.": {
    "Shortcuts: Mod+Alt+M bring to front, Mod+Alt+C chat window, Mod+Alt+Z sleep or wake, Mod+Alt+B ball, Mod+Alt+Shift+M on or off.": "快捷键：Mod+Alt+M 移到前面，Mod+Alt+C 聊天窗口，Mod+Alt+Z 睡觉或唤醒，Mod+Alt+B 球，Mod+Alt+Shift+M 开启或关闭。"
  },
  "Aibou itself is not installed: this plugin is only its switch and settings. Install it from github.com/satoshoe-dev/aibou (see the README there).": {
