  "Kuro is a dark glass ball with two long eyes, in the colour of the frame. Mochi is a rice cake with a face, Shiro a light ball with long eyes, Momo a peach, Robo a small robot with glowing eyes, Bao a steamed bun, Neko a cat, Kumo a cloud, Tako an octopus, Hiyoko a chick, Arai a raccoon. All cost the same.": {
    "Kuro is a dark glass ball with two long eyes, in the colour of the frame. Mochi is a rice cake with a face, Shiro a light ball with long eyes, Momo a peach, Robo a small robot with glowing eyes, Bao a steamed bun, Neko a cat, Kumo a cloud, Tako an octopus, Hiyoko a chick, Arai a raccoon. All cost the same.": "Kuro 是一颗带两只长眼睛的深色玻璃球，颜色与边框一致。Mochi 是一块有脸的年糕，Shiro 是一颗带长眼睛的浅色球，Momo 是桃子，Robo 是眼睛会发光的小机器人，Bao 是包子，Neko 是猫，Kumo 是云，Tako 是章鱼，Hiyoko 是小鸡，Arai 是浣熊。开销都一样。"
  },
