  "How often he sets off on his own. Minimal: he melts into the frame and mostly just watches, so he does not get in the way while you work. Maximal: always out and about, never melts in by himself, and calls a friend over for a few minutes when he is alone. Measured with one figure: normal about 3 % CPU on average, calm about 1 %, lively about 5 %.": {
    "How often he sets off on his own. Minimal: he melts into the frame and mostly just watches, so he does not get in the way while you work. Maximal: always out and about, never melts in by himself, and calls a friend over for a few minutes when he is alone. Measured with one figure: normal about 3 % CPU on average, calm about 1 %, lively about 5 %.": "它自己出去走动的频率。最低：它融入边框，大多只是看着，工作时不会碍事。最高：总在外面活动，从不自己融入边框，独自一个时会叫一个朋友来待几分钟。单个角色实测：普通平均约 3 % CPU，安静约 1 %，活泼约 5 %。"
  },
