  "While you work he melts into the bottom of the screen frame, only a dome with eyes shows. While busy: after about 45 s of steady activity, out again after 2.5 min of quiet. Always: the frame is his home. Saves CPU, because he stays still.": {
    "While you work he melts into the bottom of the screen frame, only a dome with eyes shows. While busy: after about 45 s of steady activity, out again after 2.5 min of quiet. Always: the frame is his home. Saves CPU, because he stays still.": "你工作时，它会融入屏幕底部的边框，只露出一个带眼睛的圆顶。工作时：持续活动约 45 s 后融入，安静 2.5 min 后再出来。总是：边框就是它的家。因为它保持不动，可以节省 CPU。"
