  "Bulge: a dome with eyes bulges out of the bar's inner edge. Face only: nothing sticks out, only his face shows inside the bar, in a free spot between the icons. If there is no room, he bulges out after all. The free spot is found in a screenshot of the bar (grim) that stays on this computer.": {
    "Bulge: a dome with eyes bulges out of the bar's inner edge. Face only: nothing sticks out, only his face shows inside the bar, in a free spot between the icons. If there is no room, he bulges out after all. The free spot is found in a screenshot of the bar (grim) that stays on this computer.": "鼓包：带眼睛的圆顶从栏的内侧边缘鼓出来。只露脸：什么都不突出，只在栏内图标之间的空位露出他的脸。没有空位时，他还是会鼓出来。空位是从栏的截图（grim）中找的，截图不会离开这台电脑。"
