  "Feels the machine": {
    "Feels the machine": "感知电脑状态"
  },
  "Under high load (CPU over about 60 % for a while, memory over 82 % or a hot processor) he starts to sweat, under very high load he squeezes his eyes shut. When a program crashes or a service fails he gets angry and says what broke; for that he follows the system journal and DMS's log. Checks every 2 s, practically 0.": {
    "Under high load (CPU over about 60 % for a while, memory over 82 % or a hot processor) he starts to sweat, under very high load he squeezes his eyes shut. When a program crashes or a service fails he gets angry and says what broke; for that he follows the system journal and DMS's log. Checks every 2 s, practically 0.": "负载高时（CPU 一段时间超过约 60 %、内存超过 82 % 或处理器过热）他会冒汗，负载很高时会紧闭双眼。程序崩溃或服务失败时他会生气，并说出哪里坏了；为此他会跟踪系统日志和 DMS 的日志。每 2 秒检查一次，几乎为 0。"
  },
  "Dances to music": {
    "Dances to music": "随音乐跳舞"
  },
  "When a player plays music he hops to the beat, in the frame his dome pulses along. The beat comes from cava's bass, a small cava runs only while music plays: about 1 % CPU, plus the hops. With the battery saver on battery he dances to every other beat.": {
    "When a player plays music he hops to the beat, in the frame his dome pulses along. The beat comes from cava's bass, a small cava runs only while music plays: about 1 % CPU, plus the hops. With the battery saver on battery he dances to every other beat.": "播放器放音乐时它会跟着节拍跳，在边框里则是圆顶跟着跳动。节拍取自 cava 的低音，只在播放音乐时运行一个小 cava：约 1 % CPU，再加上跳动的开销。使用电池且开启省电时，它每隔一拍跳一次。"
  },
  "Chat": {
    "Chat": "聊天"
