  "Chat through Claude in its own window; he jumps into it. The session keeps running in the background, so answers start after about one second and arrive word by word. What you write goes to Anthropic or the provider chosen below. A line starting with ! runs as a command in bash, like in a terminal. 0 locally; each answer counts against the Claude quota.": {
    "Chat through Claude in its own window; he jumps into it. The session keeps running in the background, so answers start after about one second and arrive word by word. What you write goes to Anthropic or the provider chosen below. A line starting with ! runs as a command in bash, like in a terminal. 0 locally; each answer counts against the Claude quota.": "在独立窗口里通过 Claude 聊天；他会跳进去。会话在后台持续运行，所以回答大约一秒后开始，逐词出现。你写的内容会发送给 Anthropic 或下面选择的服务商。以 ! 开头的一行会像在终端里一样作为 bash 命令运行。本地为 0；每次回答都计入 Claude 额度。"
  },
