  "In the chat he may look things up on the desktop (files, read-only commands like niri msg -j windows and dms ipc get) and knows the desktop skill. He reads only the desktop's config folders (niri, DMS, Quickshell, GTK, Qt, kitty) and folders you add; files named like tokens, passwords or keys are always refused. Changes he only proposes as a card; nothing runs until you click Run. Root rights, restarting DMS or niri and resets are always blocked. What he reads goes to the chat provider along with your message.": {
    "In the chat he may look things up on the desktop (files, read-only commands like niri msg -j windows and dms ipc get) and knows the desktop skill. He reads only the desktop's config folders (niri, DMS, Quickshell, GTK, Qt, kitty) and folders you add; files named like tokens, passwords or keys are always refused. Changes he only proposes as a card; nothing runs until you click Run. Root rights, restarting DMS or niri and resets are always blocked. What he reads goes to the chat provider along with your message.": "在聊天中他可以查看桌面（文件、只读命令，如 niri msg -j windows 和 dms ipc get），并了解桌面技能。他只读取桌面的配置文件夹（niri、DMS、Quickshell、GTK、Qt、kitty）以及你添加的文件夹；名称像令牌、密码或密钥的文件一律拒绝。更改他只以卡片形式提议；在你点击“运行”之前什么都不会执行。root 权限、重启 DMS 或 niri 以及重置始终被阻止。他读取的内容会随你的消息发送给聊天服务商。"
  },
  "Notices what happens": {
    "Notices what happens": "留意发生的事"
  },
  "He reacts when a download lands in ~/Downloads, a USB drive is plugged in, a program uses the microphone or records the screen, a long build or package run ends, or updates are waiting. For this he watches ~/Downloads, USB events and the audio streams, looks at the names of the running programs every 15 s and runs checkupdates every 3 hours. Nothing leaves the computer. Practically 0.": {
    "He reacts when a download lands in ~/Downloads, a USB drive is plugged in, a program uses the microphone or records the screen, a long build or package run ends, or updates are waiting. For this he watches ~/Downloads, USB events and the audio streams, looks at the names of the running programs every 15 s and runs checkupdates every 3 hours. Nothing leaves the computer. Practically 0.": "当下载落入 ~/Downloads、插入 USB 驱动器、有程序使用麦克风或录制屏幕、长时间的构建或软件包操作结束、或有更新等待时，他会做出反应。为此他会监视 ~/Downloads、USB 事件和音频流，每 15 秒查看一次正在运行的程序名称，并每 3 小时运行一次 checkupdates。没有任何内容离开这台电脑。几乎为 0。"
  }
